  "_comment": "Single source of truth for medallion table shapes. Consumed by starter/tests/validate_alert_rules.py (T14) to prove every Activator rule references columns that actually exist, and by starter/tests/test_contract_matches_reality.py to prove this file matches what the transforms actually emit. Derived by reading the transforms directly, not from documentation.",
